flowchart TD
    Code["Application C source:<br/>DTRACE_PROBE2 macro<br/>declares 'malloc_entry' probe"]
    Compiled["Compiled binary:<br/>nop instruction at probe site<br/>+ ELF .note.stapsdt section<br/>describing each probe"]

    Code --> Compiled

    Find["libbpf at attach reads .note.stapsdt:<br/>finds 'malloc_entry' provider+probe<br/>locates the nop offset"]
    InstallU["installs uprobe at the nop offset<br/>(same mechanism as regular uprobe)"]

    Compiled --> Find
    Find --> InstallU

    Trap["nop becomes int3 at attach;<br/>every probe site fires"]
    BPF["BPF program runs<br/>with arg values from registers"]

    InstallU --> Trap
    Trap --> BPF

    classDef app fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef att fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef rt fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Code,Compiled app
    class Find,InstallU att
    class Trap,BPF rt
